    "body": "# Fix: `updateNotification`\n\n## Explanation\n\nThe object's monitor is required to be owned by the thread that wants to modify its state. If a thread calls notify() or notifyAll() on an object without first acquiring its monitor, it will receive this error message. The\n\n---\n\n## Modified Method\n\n| Property | Value |\n|---|---|\n| Method | `updateNotification` |\n| Class | `max.music_cyclon.service.ProgressUpdater` |\n| File | `/mnt/c/Users/Antonow/Documents/tcc-openspec-v2/cloned_projects_sample/max.music_cyclon_4.apk/app/src/main/java/max/music_cyclon/service/ProgressUpdater.java` |\n| Status | `SUCCESS` |\n\n---\n\n## Changed File\n\n```text\n/mnt/c/Users/Antonow/Documents/tcc-openspec-v2/cloned_projects_sample/max.music_cyclon_4.apk/app/src/main/java/max/music_cyclon/service/ProgressUpdater.java\n```\n\n---\n\n\n## Validation Checklist\n\n- [x] Method replaced in source file\n- [x] Repository updated\n- [x] Commit generated\n- [ ] Manual review required\n- [ ] CI validation pending\n\n---\n\nRepair Pipeline",
